    "reviews": "\u201cAnyone who likes puzzle games, physics games, platforming and manipulating 3D environments will love Squishies.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 SquareXO<br><br>\u201cA nice mixture of classic platforming and puzzles set in an interesting VR world.\u201d<br>8.3/10 \u2013 4Players<br><br>\u201cSquishies is a wonderful puzzle game that convinces with imaginative levels &amp; mechanics, colorful visuals &amp; a wonderful use of VR as a medium.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 PSNow<br>",
